      "translation": "Zapisane zastąpienie stanu zasobów. Obsługa w czasie uruchomienia zależy od aktywnego upscalera innego niż DLSS oraz graficznego interfejsu API.",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saves_the_in_game_xefg_precheck_bypass_request_d_fdc00aff",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saves the in-game XeFG precheck bypass request. Do not use this to skip a motion-vector size warning for Unreal Engine games. Runtime compatibility is not established by this preference.",
